Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:18.68,Title,,0,0,0,,THE CATCH\NIN BLINKIT'S PROFIT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:18.68,Foot,,0,0,0,,Sources: Business Standard · Indian Startup News\NFull video on the channel
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.15,0:00:02.40,Big,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1640)\fad(120,150)}NEW STORES LOSE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Blinkit finally makes a profit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.70,0:00:04.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}But one thing could wipe it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.33,0:00:06.19,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Every new store loses money at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.19,0:00:11.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}And Blinkit is opening hundreds of them, while Swiggy Instamart, Zepto and others fight for the same customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.23,0:00:16.33,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}If the new stores mature like the old ones, Blinkit becomes a retail giant.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.33,0:00:18.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}If they don't, the profit disappears again.
